# Demolition Field: "nonbasic" is the supertype, not the land types. Bot2's Snow-Covered Plains is a basic land (CR 205.4a),
# so it is refused as a target; Bot2's Tundra has basic land types but is not basic, so it is accepted and destroyed. Bot2 declines
# its search and so does Bot1, so only the destruction shows.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Demolition Field
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Snow-Covered Plains
Tundra
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Snow-Covered Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Tundra.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Demolition Field.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Demolition Field.Activate(Ability: Destroy; Bot2.Battlefield.Snow-Covered Plains)
Bot1.Battlefield.Demolition Field.Activate(Ability: Destroy; Bot2.Battlefield.Tundra)
Bot2.Decline
Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Demolition Field
Bot2.Graveyard = Tundra
Bot2.Battlefield = Snow-Covered Plains
